### Better Auth API Test File

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@authPath = /api/auth

### Health Check / Get CSRF Token
GET {{baseUrl}}{{authPath}}/get-session
Content-Type: application/json

### Sign Up with Email & Password
POST {{baseUrl}}{{authPath}}/sign-up/email
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"email": "user@example.com",
	"password": "password123",
	"name": "Test User"
}

### Sign In with Email & Password
# @name signIn
POST {{baseUrl}}{{authPath}}/sign-in/email
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"email": "user@example.com",
	"password": "password123"
}

### Capture Session Token (Requires REST Client extension)
@sessionToken = {{signIn.response.headers.$set-cookie}}

### Get Current Session (Authenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{authPath}}/get-session
Cookie: {{sessionToken}}

### Sign Out
POST {{baseUrl}}{{authPath}}/sign-out
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Cookie: {{sessionToken}}

### List User Accounts (Authenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{authPath}}/list-accounts
Cookie: {{sessionToken}}

### Update User (Authenticated)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{authPath}}/update-user
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionToken}}

{
	"name": "Updated Name",
	"image": "https://example.com/avatar.png"
}
